{"unit_id":"regrevia__dsh-mobile-use#card-zh","repo":"regrevia/dsh-mobile-use","commit":"674840015e35b74d35d63b3fd0c635f750a58eec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-use 是一款面向 DSH Web 右栏的 Android 真机调试插件。它注册 adb 工具，并提供实时设备镜像面板，让模型读取控件文本树、查找控件并执行点击、输入、滑动和组合操作。用户也可在侧栏直接查看画面、点按或圈选区域并把标注带回会话。适合需要从 DSH 检查和操作连接设备的开发者；需要本机 adb，视频镜像还需 ffmpeg。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4431-4588","index.js:5633-6034","index.js:8193-8240"]}
{"unit_id":"regrevia__dsh-mobile-use#card-en","repo":"regrevia/dsh-mobile-use","commit":"674840015e35b74d35d63b3fd0c635f750a58eec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mobile-use adds Android tools to the DSH sidebar. Agents can read UI text, find controls, tap, type, swipe, and run multi-step actions. Its live mirror lets users inspect and operate the screen, then send annotated selections to a session. Requires local adb; video mirroring also needs ffmpeg.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4431-4588","index.js:5633-6034","index.js:8193-8240"]}
